        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0043234</IRI>
        <Literal>A stable macromolecular complex composed (only) of two or more polypeptide subunits along with any covalently attached molecules (such as lipid anchors or oligosaccharide) or non-protein prosthetic groups (such as nucleotides or metal ions). Prosthetic group in this context refers to a tightly bound cofactor. The component polypeptide subunits may be identical.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
