        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000009</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">A label is a symbol that is part of some other datum and is used to either partially define  the denotation of that datum or to provide a means for identifying the datum as a member of the set of data with the same label</Literal>
