        <Literal xml:lang="en">2014-03-10: The use of &quot;thing&quot; is intended to be general enough to include universals and configurations (see https://groups.google.com/d/msg/information-ontology/GBxvYZCk1oc/-L6B5fSBBTQJ).</Literal>
