        <Literal xml:lang="en">Gene lists may arise from analysis to determine differentially expressed genes, may be collected from the literature for involvement in a particular process or pathway (e.g., inflammation), or may be the input for gene set enrichment analysis.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
