        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0200117</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">A mode calculation is a descriptive statistics calculation in which the mode is calculated which is the most common value in a data set. It is most often used as a measure of center for discrete data.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
