        <Literal xml:lang="en">Current the output of material processing defined as the molecular entity, main component in the output material entity, rather than the material entity that have grain molecular entity. 
&apos;nucleic acid extract&apos; is the output of &apos;nucleic acid extraction&apos; and has grain &apos;nucleic acid&apos;. However, the output of &apos;nucleic acid extraction&apos; is &apos;nucleic acid&apos; rather than &apos;nucleic acid extract&apos;. We are aware of this issue and will work it out in the future.</Literal>
