        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000052</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">a relation between a specifically dependent continuant (the dependent) and an independent continuant (the bearer), in which the dependent specifically depends on the bearer for its existence</Literal>
