        <Literal xml:lang="en">adapted from Wikipedia and Brown, M. B., and A. B. Forsythe. 1974a. The small sample behavior of some statistics which test the equality of several means. Technometrics, 16, 129-132.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
