        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000199</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">AGB-PRS, adapted from wikipedia (http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mauchly&apos;s_sphericity_test)
polled on june,10th, 2013
and from R manual:
http://stat.ethz.ch/R-manual/R-patched/library/stats/html/mauchly.test.html</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
