        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000263</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">Galbraith, Rex (1988). &quot;Graphical display of estimates having differing standard errors&quot;. Technometrics (Technometrics, Vol. 30, No. 3) 30 (3): 271–281. doi:10.2307/1270081. JSTOR 1270081</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
