        <Literal xml:lang="en">Breusch-Pagan test is a statistical test which computes a score test of the hypothesis of constant error variance against the alternative that the error variance changes with the level of the response (fitted values), or with a linear combination of predictors.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
