        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000292</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">a decile is a quantile where n=10  and which splits data into sections accrued of 10% of data, so the first decile delineates 10% of the data, the second decile delineates 20% of the data and the nineth decile, 90 % of the data</Literal>
