        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000370</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">the ordinary least squares estimation is a model parameter estimation for a linear regression model when the errors are uncorrelated and equal in variance. Is the Best Linear Unbiased Estimation (BLUE) method under these assumptions, Uniformly Minimum-Variance Unbiased Estimator (UMVUE) with addition of a Gaussian assumption.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117"/>
