        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116"/>
        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000380</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">AGB: this relationship requires more discussion in light of potentially adding the Effect class as per the issue: https://github.com/ISA-tools/stato/issues/75

Thus the definition is temporary.

The domain and range were &apos;variable&apos; but removing now to discuss the specific restrictions when the issue is discussed.

Not extracting to separate ontology (stato-experimental.owl) due to IDs already assigned. If deemed not necessary in the future, the IDs should be deprecated.</Literal>
