        <Literal>https://stat.ethz.ch/R-manual/R-devel/library/stats/html/summary.manova.html

## S3 method for class &apos;manova&apos;
summary(object,
        test = c(&quot;Pillai&quot;, &quot;Wilks&quot;, &quot;Hotelling-Lawley&quot;, &quot;Roy&quot;),
        intercept = FALSE, tol = 1e-7, ...)</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
