        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000457</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">The mean difference, or difference in means, measures the absolute difference between the mean value in two different groups.

The mean difference is a subtraction of one mean from another.

The primary use of this term is in analyzing between-group differences</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
