        <Literal xml:lang="en">The voluntary sampling method is a type of non-probability sampling. A voluntary sample is made up of people who self-select into the survey. Often, these subjects have a strong interest in the main topic of the survey. Volunteers may be invited through advertisements on Social Media Sites</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
