        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000517</IRI>
        <Literal>complete randomization is a group randomization where experimental units are randomly assigned to the entire set of groups defined by the experimental treatments.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
