        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000561</IRI>
        <Literal>adapted from wikipedia:
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Confidence_interval

and from:
http://www.oxfordreference.com/view/10.1093/acref/9780191792236.001.0001/acref-9780191792236-e-103?rskey=tQCMI6&amp;result=1</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
