        <Literal>Aharoni, Ehud, and Saharon Rosset. 2014. “Generalized α -investing: definitions, optimality results and application to public databases.” Journal of the Royal Statistical Society: Series B (Statistical Methodology) 76 (4): 771–94. https: //doi.org/10.1111/rssb.12048.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
