        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000606</IRI>
        <Literal>Student (1927). &quot;Errors of routine analysis&quot;. Biometrika. 19 (1/2): 151–164. doi:10.2307/2332181</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
