        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000649</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">A measure of dispersion applied to differences between proportions arising from independent groups across hypothetical repeated random samples.

A standard error is used to quantify the uncertainty around a statistical estimate due to random sampling error.</Literal>
